<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pioneer raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pioneer raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette has raised its recommendation for Pioneer Hi-Bred International Inc to buy from market perform, a market source said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed on Friday at 64-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
